---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

// Terms of service for the "Automate" TikTok developer app.
//
// TikTok's app review form takes a terms URL alongside the privacy URL. Like
// the privacy page, this is written narrow and true: the app has exactly one
// user, so terms that pretend to govern a public service would themselves be
// the submission/product mismatch reviewers reject.

const updated = '2 September 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Automate"
  description="Terms of service for Automate, a personal TikTok drafting tool."
>
  <main class="legal" id="main">
    <p class="eyebrow mono">AUTOMATE · TIKTOK INTEGRATION</p>
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="updated mono">Last updated {updated}</p>

    <h2>What Automate is</h2>
    <p>
      Automate is a private tool operated by May Abiodun. It prepares image carousels and
      uploads them to her own TikTok account as <strong>drafts</strong>, which a human then
      reviews and publishes from the TikTok app. It does not publish anything on its own.
    </p>

    <h2>Who may use it</h2>
    <p>
      The operator only. It is not offered to the public, has no sign-up, and accepts no
      third-party accounts. If that changes, these terms and the privacy policy will be
      rewritten before it does.
    </p>

    <h2>Relationship to TikTok</h2>
    <p>
      Automate is an independent tool. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by
      TikTok or ByteDance. It uses TikTok's public developer APIs under TikTok's Developer
      Terms of Service, and the operator is responsible for its use of those APIs. TikTok's
      own terms and Community Guidelines govern any content that ends up on the platform.
    </p>

    <h2>Content</h2>
    <p>
      All content uploaded through the tool is created by the operator, who is responsible
      for it. Images are generated with AI assistance and are reviewed by a human before
      anything is published. Nothing is published without that review.
    </p>

    <h2>Availability</h2>
    <p>
      The tool is provided as-is, with no warranty and no uptime commitment. It is a personal
      utility and may be changed or switched off at any time.
    </p>

    <h2>Access</h2>
    <p>
      The operator may revoke the app's access to her TikTok account at any time through
      TikTok's settings. Doing so stops the integration immediately.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p><a href="mailto:silkvoice1214@gmail.com">silkvoice1214@gmail.com</a></p>

    <p class="foot mono"><a href="/tiktok/privacy">Privacy Policy →</a></p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1.25rem 6rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .legal h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.8rem); line-height: 1.1; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  .updated { font-size: 0.78rem; opacity: 0.6; margin: 0 0 2.5rem; }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 2.2rem 0 0.6rem; }
  .foot { margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 0.82rem; }
</style>
